    "description": {
      "value": "You conjure an arrow of acid that continues corroding the target after it hits. Make a spell attack against the target.\n\nOn a hit, you deal 3d8 acid damage plus 1d6 persistent acid damage. On a critical hit, double the initial damage, but not the persistent damage."
    },
